"6 result(s) across 21st.dev (metadata only).\n\n### [component] Services  [id: 4192]\nby ravikatiyar162\nI crafted this services section to clearly showcase what the business offers, making it easy for visitors to understand our value at a glance.\npreview: https://cdn.21st.dev/ravikatiyar162/services/default/preview.1753035767112.png\ninstall: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/ravikatiyar162/services?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"\n\u2192 get the code: get_component({ id: 4192 })\n\n### [component] Services Card  [id: 7795]\nby ravikatiyar162\nServices Card \u2013 Showcase offerings. Modern UI component to present branding, development, or SEO services with clear visuals and descriptions. Ideal for portfolios and business websites.\npreview: https://cdn.21st.dev/ravikatiyar162/services-card/default/preview.1758279268638.png\ninstall: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/ravikatiyar162/services-card?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"\n\u2192 get the code: get_component({ id: 7795 })\n\n### [component] Service Card  [id: 8223]\nby lavikatiyar\nService Card\nA visually engaging card component designed to showcase services or features. It includes a title, a call-to-action link, and a decorative image. The card features a subtle, fluid animation on hover to draw user attention.\npreview: https://cdn.21st.dev/lavikatiyar/service-card/default/preview.1758962818948.png\ninstall: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/lavikatiyar/service-card?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"\n\u2192 get the code: get_component({ id: 8223 })\n\n### [component] Service Grid  [id: 8126]\nby ravikatiyar162\nServiceGrid\nA responsive grid component designed to showcase a list of services or features. Each item in the grid consists of an image and a title. The component features a staggered fade-in animation for the grid items and a subtle hover effect, all while being fully theme-adaptive using shadcn/ui CSS variables.\npreview: https://cdn.21st.dev/ravikatiyar162/service-grid/default/preview.1758849231647.png\ninstall: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/ravikatiyar162/service-grid?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"\n\u2192 get the code: get_component({ id: 8126 })\n\n### [component] Services with Animated Hover Modal  [id: 11688]\nby cnippet-dev\nA responsive services component that displays a list of offerings. On hover, a modal follows the cursor, revealing project images with smooth scaling and transition effects. Built with GSAP for cursor\u2011following animations and Framer Motion for scale transitions.\npreview: https://cdn.21st.dev/cnippet.dev/services-with-animated-hover-modal/default/preview.1774625573593.png\ninstall: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/cnippet-dev/services-with-animated-hover-modal?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"\n\u2192 get the code: get_component({ id: 11688 })\n\n### [component] Service Changelog  [id: 16247]\nby ruixen.ui\nA scroll-spy services section. A sticky tab strip at the top tracks the active entry while the reader scrolls through long-form panels with deliverables, optional preview media, and inline CTAs.\npreview: https://cdn.21st.dev/ruixen.ui/service-changelog/default/preview.1782458947184.png\ninstall: npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/ruixen.ui/service-changelog?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"\n\u2192 get the code: get_component({ id: 16247 })\n\nMetadata is free. get_component (the code) is the PAID step - on the free tier it uses your daily retrieval quota (see get_usage)."